# Vendored GNU FriBidi

Upstream: https://github.com/fribidi/fribidi  
Version: **1.0.16** (LGPL-2.1+)  
License: see [COPYING](COPYING)

Sources under `lib/` are copied from the upstream release tarball. `lib/fribidi-config.h` and `config.h` are generated for this tree (normally produced by configure/meson). `config.h` omits `HAVE_STRINGS_H` on MSVC (`strings.h` is POSIX-only). MSVC CMake does not compile these sources -- it links the vcpkg `fribidi:x64-windows` port instead (see `.github/workflows/ci.yml`).

## Refresh

```bash
./scripts/vendor-fribidi.sh
```
